{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "72", "x": 0.9046226758746378, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029120572728997943, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "part1", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1535204281709998, "w": 0.06216650554870176, "h": 0.02039118517446672, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1841572905116062, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Oh, definitely tangerines! They're the perfect combo of sweetness and", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.1841572905116062, "w": 0.7655690293849846, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "tanginess, and they're super juicy when you peel them. Plus, the bright orange", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21248764058574382, "w": 0.8259247520152049, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "colour is an instant mood booster for me. What appeals to me the most is that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24081799065988144, "w": 0.8259245469652973, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "they're not as overpriced as other trendy \"superfruits\" these days, yet they're", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2691484161768041, "w": 0.8263949314533537, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "packed with vitamin C. That's why they've always been my go-to fruit.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2975158841011724, "w": 0.7089049227664144, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.35417656538875136, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, if you ask me, I'd say durian. I know it's widely known as the \"king of", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.35417656538875136, "w": 0.7654700928045629, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "fruits\" and loved by many of my friends, but I just can't stand its pungent smell-it", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3823585949475363, "w": 0.826817129213122, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reminds me of rotting onions. The texture's even worse; it's like swallowing", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4106889827430665, "w": 0.8260989419117193, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sweetened clotted cream mixed with stringy bits. Honestly, even durian-flavoured", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.43901937053859663, "w": 0.8267489501188418, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "candies freak me out!", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46737446584622133, "w": 0.22383806675666307, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5240352037158891, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Personally, it's not my cup of tea. For example, in China there's a dish called", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.5240352037158891, "w": 0.766091496549574, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "pineapple pork which is a famous Cantonese dish. I've tried it a few times, but I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5523655537900267, "w": 0.8259901629357324, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "just can't get used to the way warm, mushy fruit clashes with salty flavours-it", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5806959415855568, "w": 0.8268663411909484, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "feels wrong to me. If you ask my opinion, fruits are meant to be eaten raw to get", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6090262916596945, "w": 0.8267168598083009, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "their natural zing.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6373566417338321, "w": 0.18347322350655232, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "4.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.694054459732338, "w": 0.025447283052840438, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "lf I'm in a rush, I'll just order fruit through grocery delivery apps. They'll leave", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.694054459732338, "w": 0.7658397977879831, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it at my doorstep within an hour! But for better quality and prices, I go to a nearby", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7223848852492607, "w": 0.8259902654606861, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "wholesale market. The produce there is freshly harvested, and there's a much", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7507152353233983, "w": 0.8265358007398815, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "wider variety. Plus, I actually enjoy haggling with the vendors- it adds to the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.779045585397536, "w": 0.8266948169432329, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "experience.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8073760109144585, "w": 0.12340467327193934, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "part2", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.866056465303335, "w": 0.06740751710910797, "h": 0.020391204035162976, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}